{
  "nl": "会员卡列表：按卡号、等级、余额三列展示，顺序照此。等级列可以按等级多选筛选（普通/黄金/白金），卡号列可以按关键字做文本包含筛选。支持新增、编辑、删除。",
  "nlEn": "Membership card list: the table shows card number, level and balance in that order. The level column can be filtered by multiple levels (regular/gold/platinum); the card-number column supports text-contains filtering. Supports add, edit and delete.",
  "fixedFields": [
    "cardNo",
    "level",
    "balance"
  ],
  "pinnedDims": [
    "propSet",
    "actions",
    "columns"
  ],
  "nlStatedDims": [
    "propSet",
    "actions",
    "columns"
  ],
  "config": {
    "name": "MemberCardManage",
    "apiUrl": "/api/member-cards",
    "target": "antdv",
    "mode": "sfc",
    "fields": [
      {
        "prop": "cardNo",
        "label": "卡号",
        "formtype": "Input"
      },
      {
        "prop": "level",
        "label": "等级",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "dataOptions": [
          { "label": "普通", "value": 1 },
          { "label": "黄金", "value": 2 },
          { "label": "白金", "value": 3 }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "balance",
        "label": "余额",
        "formtype": "InputNumber"
      }
    ],
    "columns": [
      {
        "prop": "cardNo",
        "label": "卡号",
        "filters": [
          { "text": "62 开头", "value": "62" }
        ],
        "filterMode": "includes"
      },
      {
        "prop": "level",
        "label": "等级",
        "filters": [
          { "text": "普通", "value": 1 },
          { "text": "黄金", "value": 2 },
          { "text": "白金", "value": 3 }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "balance",
        "label": "余额"
      }
    ],
    "actions": [
      "add",
      "edit",
      "delete"
    ]
  },
  "notes": "W3-2 列筛选（SFC 模式 + antdv）：pushSfcColumn 把 filters 作为纯 JSON 列字面量发射、filterMultiple / filterMode 作为标量发射；a-table 适配器再映射成 filters + filterMultiple + onFilter。与 197 成对，覆盖 generator 的两种模式。"
}
